#	Input			: NA
#	Output			: NA
#	Called Script	:
#	Calling Scrip	: NA
#	Menu Option		: CCCSM
#	Srl. No			Date			Author			Description.
#	-------			---------		-------			---------------
#	1.0				01-03-2013		GOKULKRISHNA			Original Version
#	2.0				29-08-2013		Priyanka T 		Calling common script to append userId - TOL - 367144
